<description>&lt;p&gt;Canada and the Philippines concluded talks on a free trade deal, deepening economic ties, while Australia and the Philippines signed a defence agreement in response to heightened South China Sea tensions. Chinese authorities deployed unauthorized buoys that the Philippines says create maritime hazards, and Chinese vessels continue patrols near contested features. The Philippine Coast Guard removed oil from a sunken landing craft tank off Surigao del Sur, and 10ID and partners held an intelligence workshop to boost cooperation. There were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/canada-and-the-philippines-conclude-talks-on-free-trade-deal-mark-carney-says&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNLWtfU0tTallmSTNzSmZKOU9KVlRyalhxM1ZJaWphN3c0eHRIalJaUVNpWTdvTzRQWmZ4WHl6YW9qYmJwMUl1aDZIQlA3UGFBY21ka0xsbjNnWExMMWRJdzNkcFFjRnJpZVVoQmNLbm9xT0R0U2l0U3IzWlVEX3RENXNIQmJYWDQ0dnEyV2EzVFNVeS1rQWxMcTNuazVuODVtci02VmNvenFiSlg4em1PaWIwRkpkR0JH0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1XeVBEYmozamdmTXpQc2h1Tnp5TVZJeEU0dVVnQnd0VnRCc1dPU19FSHpjM0J1WjJVUWFLUE5SZjV5MzNnbks0R2Vmd3lXQTRsd1hLeTF2ZjdvTkNJZ1RwYi1UcGRhU09pZS0zVXlvN3NfaW92WEZ3MGdHWlJ6ek10TjZ1MzM2MzN5VXc4QlhuTXVhS0pyM0N6NmtfdTRubmkyamJabHBOVklVemM1S1dJUHZHUTYzZXpMd3k3X3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPYVRnb1lWR1JIeU1fbDU4aUdJdEI5Qmp2VUgwX0JQT1Y4TUNkNDdRSXhWbnhfcW9vRHA3Q2g5cnl0ZTFPeG0zMllieExDS0RpanlZUGlyWDVrYnB6blBNdURHUDc4RWxveGFvZWN3TWg0RThrNkJrb2dwSkd0OGxOY3c5WU13azlveHU0NmxkZHF2dkhoQ1lYV0NCRWdKUi1CMllDU3duQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95